格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Verified, star-ranked community plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh).","id":"gh:1334804950","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"awesome-dsh-plugins","slug":"jqueryscript/awesome-dsh-plugins","topics":["ai-agents","awesome","awesome-list","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Verified, star-ranked community plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Awesome DeepSeek Harness Plugins [](https://awesome.re)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A verified, category-organized list of community plugins for DeepSeek Harness, with exact GitHub S"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"d, category-organized list of community plugins for DeepSeek Harness, with exact GitHub Star counts."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Last verified:** 2026-09-28 | **Minimum at admission:** 30 stars | **Plugins:** 694"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Latest additions:** 2026-11-04. Existing entries retain their previous Star snapshots."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- What qualifies\n- Plugins by category\n- Files & Runtime\n- Input & Navigation\n- Memory & Knowledge\n-"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" Themes & Appearance\n- UI & Interfaces\n- Vision\n- Workflow & Automation\n- Install plugins carefully\n"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"e\n- UI & Interfaces\n- Vision\n- Workflow & Automation\n- Install plugins carefully\n- Related resources"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What qualifies"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Every listed project has at least 30 GitHub Stars at admission and a public repository with an ident"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ifiable `dsh.bundle` manifest, bundle patch, plugin entry, and documented installation path. Multi-p"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"latform projects qualify only when they ship a separate DSH bundle."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic is a discovery signal, not proof. This list excludes topic-only reposi"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"tories, generic Skills, standalone clients without a bundle, MCP servers without a DSH package, API "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"wrappers, presets, tutorials, Awesome lists, archived repositories, and minimally changed forks."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Plugins by category"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Each category below contains the actual plugin entries. Entries within a category are sorted by reco"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"w contains the actual plugin entries. Entries within a category are sorted by recorded GitHub Stars."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Files & Runtime"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- OpenDesign DSH Runtime - **98.5k stars** | `Apache-2.0`. A DeepSeek Harness profile bundle that co"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nnects OpenDesign to a user-installed DSH runtime through a structured stdio protocol.\n- Install: `p"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"npm --filter @open-design/dsh-runtime build && pnpm -C packages/dsh-runtime pack --pack-destination "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"<temporary-directory> && dsh plugin --profile open-design add <temporary-directory>/open-design-dsh-"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ry> && dsh plugin --profile open-design add <temporary-directory>/open-design-dsh-runtime-0.1.0.tgz`"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Mirage DSH - **3.7k stars** | `Apache-2.0`. A DSH filesystem and shell provider that mounts remote"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" and local resources inside one virtual workspace.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add @strukto"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ources inside one virtual workspace.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add @struktoai/mirage-dsh`"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- DSH Purge - **2.5k stars** | `MIT`. Adds a DSH settings panel for managing prompt rules, permissio"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"n policies, and tool-limit patches.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/YuJu"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"nZhiXue/dsh-purge/archive/refs/heads/master.zip`"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- API Relay Audit DSH - **860 stars** | `AGPL-3.0-only`. A DeepSeek Harness bundle for auditing API "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"relays for prompt injection, model substitution, tool-call rewriting, SSE anomalies, and error leaka"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ge.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add \"github:toby-bridges/api-relay-audit#v2.4.0\"`"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Our Free Model DSH - **713 stars** | `MIT`. Add an upstream model gateway, availability checks, us"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"age charts, and a local forwarding endpoint to DSH.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add /absolu"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"te/path/to/dsh-our-free-model`"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- SandBase Harness - **675 stars** | `Apache-2.0`. A DSH bundle that connects the managed-agents run"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"time through the official stdio MCP client.\n- Install: `npm ci && npm run build:runtime && npm link "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"&& dsh plugin --profile web add managed-agents`"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- DSH k8e Sandbox - **498 stars** | `Apache-2.0`. A DeepSeek Harness sandbox bundle that routes file"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"system and subprocess services through the k8e sandbox runtime.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile <na"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"me> add @k8e-sandbox/dsh-k8e-sandbox-bundle`"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- DSH Git Worktree Bundle - **483 stars** | `BSD-3-Clause`. Manage Git worktrees through official DS"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"H Web slots with separate workspaces and sessions for each checkout.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Input & Navigation"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- BrowserSkill DSH Plugin - **7.7k stars** | `MIT`. A DeepSeek Harness bundle that exposes BrowserSk"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ill browser automation tools for sessions, navigation, snapshots, clicks, forms, and screenshots.\n- "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add @wxg-prc-cpg/browser-skill-dsh-plugin`"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- OpenGUI DSH - **1.8k stars** | `MIT`. A DSH plugin for controlling authorized Android phones and a"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" managed local browser through delegated tasks.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add ./deepseek-"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"browser through delegated tasks.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add ./deepseek-harness-plugin`"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- DSH Pocket - **1.4k stars** | `GPL-2.0`. A Web plugin that mirrors DSH sessions to a phone over a "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"local network or a password-protected Cloudflare tunnel.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add ds"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"k or a password-protected Cloudflare tunnel.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-pocket -w`"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- DSH AionUI Panel - **764 stars** | `Apache-2.0`. Browse workspace files, Git changes, and document"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" previews in a DSH right-side panel.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add @linxin666/dsh-client-"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"SH right-side panel.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add @linxin666/dsh-client-ui-aionui-panel`"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- DSH Antibrow - **577 stars** | `MIT`. A DeepSeek Harness browser plugin with persistent identities"},{"id":"p27s2","text":", per-profile cookies and passkeys, and optional residential proxy egress.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"profile <name> add dsh-antibrow`"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- DSH At File - **512 stars** | `MIT`. A composer extension for searching workspace paths with at-fi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"le mentions and attaching file contents to prompts.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add https:/"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"/github.com/FSMargoo/dsh-at-file/archive/refs/tags/v0.6.0.tar.gz`"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- DSH Mobile - **329 stars** | `Apache-2.0`. A DeepSeek Harness mobile bundle with touch-friendly na"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"vigation and a compact conversation layout.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-mobile@alph"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"gation and a compact conversation layout.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-mobile@alpha`"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- DSH Ego Browser - **321 stars** | `MIT`. Run browser automation tools through the bundled Ego runt"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ime and watch browser activity in a live panel.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-ego-bro"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ch browser activity in a live panel.\n- Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-ego-browser@0.9.2`"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- DSH Free Search - **269 stars** | `MIT`. A multi-engine DSH search provider with free backends, au"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"tomatic fallback, settings, and platform search.\n- Install: `git clone https://github.com/DDDMUC/dsh"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"-free-search.git && dsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-free-search`"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Memory & Knowledge"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Themes & Appearance"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
